# Apocalypse Nigh (battlefield.apocalypse_nigh, Empyreal Paradox): a level 75 char with the quest accepted and
# Quest[3][89]Prog 3 triggers the entrance. Updates 0 (ignored), 4, 16 and 20 (REQS_NOT_MET), then 17 (area 1):
# registered and entered. The area's mobs killed: the win, event 32001, its finish (its setPos zones the char out),
# the cleanup.
lists EmpyrealParadox/TR_Entrance/onTrigger EmpyrealParadox/onEventUpdate/32000 EmpyrealParadox/onEventFinish/32000 EmpyrealParadox/onEventFinish/32001
char zone=EmpyrealParadox pos=541.5,-1.2,-597.7 job=WAR lvl=75
quest Jeuno.ApocalypseNigh accepted
charvar Quest[3][89]Prog 3
login
trigger TR_Entrance
update 32000 option=0
update 32000 option=4
update 32000 option=16
update 32000 option=20
update 32000 option=17
finish
kill KAMLANAUT
kill KAMLANAUT+1
finish
tick 11000
tick 10000
